{"task_id": "e22bb7e027fed409", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "From the second equation, \\(x_3-x_2=2\\). The third equation then gives \\(x_1=0\\). Substituting into the first equation yields \\(x_2+x_3=0\\), so \\(x_2=-1\\) and \\(x_3=1\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [0, -1, 1]}", "parsed_answer": "[0, -1, 1]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 5429, "usage": {"input": 293, "output": 282, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 198, "totalTokens": 575, "cost": {"input": 5.860000000000001e-05, "output": 0.0003384, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.000397}}, "cost_usd": 0.000397, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_04fcc9aad7e9fbee016ad57c7d7a6487d1a97c590ed77004d8"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:11+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:17+00:00"}
{"task_id": "4fac20d29191e3a2", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Using the second equation, \\(x_1 = 1 + 3x_2 - 4x_3\\). Substituting into the first and third equations gives:\n\\[\n-16x_2 + 25x_3 = -16,\\qquad 9x_2 - 5x_3 = 9.\n\\]\nSolving yields \\(x_2=1\\), \\(x_3=0\\), and therefore \\(x_1=4\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [4, 1, 0]}", "parsed_answer": "[4, 1, 0]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 6084, "usage": {"input": 294, "output": 435, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 315, "totalTokens": 729, "cost": {"input": 5.8800000000000006e-05, "output": 0.000522, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0005808}}, "cost_usd": 0.0005808, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_0a64704ca498fd56016ad57c7d765c87d1a9ed9ea3c6a02df6"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:11+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:18+00:00"}
{"task_id": "7e1d5aed4b26834e", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Subtracting the first equation from the third gives\n\\[\n5x_2+3x_3+6x_4=22.\n\\]\nEliminating \\(x_1\\) using the third and fourth equations gives\n\\[\n34x_2+9x_3+48x_4=101.\n\\]\nTogether with\n\\[\n-2x_2+5x_3-x_4=7,\n\\]\nthis yields\n\\[\nx_2=5,\\quad x_3=3,\\quad x_4=-2.\n\\]\nSubstituting into the third equation gives \\(x_1=-5\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [-5, 5, 3, -2]}", "parsed_answer": "[-5, 5, 3, -2]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 9015, "usage": {"input": 319, "output": 922, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 766, "totalTokens": 1241, "cost": {"input": 6.38e-05, "output": 0.0011064, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0011702}}, "cost_usd": 0.0011702, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_0734aebbc855d4c8016ad57c82c4bc87d18349e84de7c815da"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:17+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:26+00:00"}
{"task_id": "c5f4598586596232", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Using the third equation to eliminate \\(x_1\\) gives:\n\\[\n17x_2-39x_3+2x_4=19,\n\\]\n\\[\n-44x_2+69x_3+16x_4=-187,\n\\]\n\\[\n-22x_2+43x_3+7x_4=-80.\n\\]\n\nEliminating \\(x_4\\) yields:\n\\[\n163x_2-359x_3=293,\\qquad 180x_2-381x_3=339.\n\\]\nThus \\(x_3=1\\), \\(x_2=4\\), and then \\(x_4=-5\\). Substituting into the third original equation gives \\(x_1=-6\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [-6, 4, 1, -5]}", "parsed_answer": "[-6, 4, 1, -5]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 11237, "usage": {"input": 331, "output": 1207, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1021, "totalTokens": 1538, "cost": {"input": 6.620000000000001e-05, "output": 0.0014483999999999999, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0015145999999999998}}, "cost_usd": 0.0015145999999999998, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_00ca60ddfbf724c8016ad57c837b9887d1adf48743accdb9c1"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:18+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:29+00:00"}
{"task_id": "aed802a3c0a19460", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Using the fourth equation,\n\\[\nx_1=-1+3x_2+x_3-8x_4-5x_5.\n\\]\nSubstituting this into the other equations and solving the resulting system gives\n\\[\nx_2=-7,\\quad x_3=-7,\\quad x_4=-6,\\quad x_5=4,\\quad x_6=6.\n\\]\nThen\n\\[\nx_1=-1+3(-7)+(-7)-8(-6)-5(4)=-1.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\": [-1, -7, -7, -6, 4, 6]}", "parsed_answer": "[-1, -7, -7, -6, 4, 6]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 36304, "usage": {"input": 418, "output": 4285, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 4142, "totalTokens": 4703, "cost": {"input": 8.360000000000001e-05, "output": 0.005142, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0052255999999999995}}, "cost_usd": 0.0052255999999999995, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_0d1d93993020fd78016ad57c8bb5e087d18ebd86771ed354d1"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:26+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:13:02+00:00"}
{"task_id": "cd25df1322507d3b", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Using the fourth equation to eliminate \\(x_1\\), followed by exact Gaussian elimination, gives\n\\[\nx_3=-3,\\quad x_4=-5,\\quad x_5=0,\\quad x_6=-1.\n\\]\nSubstituting back yields \\(x_2=9\\) and \\(x_1=-1\\). Therefore:\n{\"answer\": [-1, 9, -3, -5, 0, -1]}", "parsed_answer": "[-1, 9, -3, -5, 0, -1]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 43544, "usage": {"input": 422, "output": 5203, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 5101, "totalTokens": 5625, "cost": {"input": 8.44e-05, "output": 0.006243599999999999, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.006327999999999999}}, "cost_usd": 0.006327999999999999, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_0e41134f09444941016ad57c8ea2c887d1ab009d7a6507da76"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:29+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:13:12+00:00"}
